= Constitutional Court rules on the Nuclear Tax

In yet another ruling against Catalan laws, the Constitutional Court has struck down the recently implemented taxes on Nuclear electricity. The ruling is based on it being considered a duplication of an existing State-wide levy on radioactive waste, yet the most critical will see yet another denial on Catalonia having any say in its energy sector. 

